Yes, it has.
And they are indeed pretty useful for various reasons (most notable is  
indeed knowing what to drop when encumbered without having to know the  
weights of objects as well as the max carrying capacity by heart)
The drawback I find with them is that they make identification of some  
objects (GoP, bags, ...) completely trivial or easier than in a normal  
game, which sure helps but, well, ... (gray stone are not weighted, hence  
loadstones are still an issue).

Well, of course, one could argue that knowing your max capacity (easy to  
compute) and having enough object to reach it (not too hard), you can get  
the exact same information by taking and droping different items. I must  
confess I never do this in Nethack (maybe I'm too lazy for it)...

